      "eyebrow": "Read the evidence",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "role": "example",
          "text": "A current object listing is not complete version cleanup. The bucket also needs all versions and delete markers removed. Inspect retained and failed resources rather than assuming the completed operation removed everything; this flow verifies deletion, not charges.",
